## 1. Anchor and reachability
gh api repos/FedorMilovanov/gb-is-my-strength/commits/main -q '.sha+"  "+.commit.committer.date'
gh api repos/FedorMilovanov/AuditRepo/commits/main -q '.sha+"  "+.commit.committer.date'
